{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:de8adcbfd5d4fbf0e4a44fbe7d346d98d23509e53a86b8dbe260186f262e5075",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e20108b69065abd906b812da7d9fe9afadca45296cb46fe610ce0d9990b3b50",
      "text": "早就入部了，是什么意思啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4fc62e12f20beb4392eed5778c2ca421259b22103273dbc1a5d6101ad6bd124",
      "text": "哎呀，其实我是留级了两次的高二学生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1a07828f65fe3831e70fee393a05ac92c541ca6fb48c5baa1b4ddac46cd3bb3",
      "text": "我完全给忘了，\n不过高一的时候好像确实报了这个部。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201e387d3e1b49c7c1638a9dca6c3551743489675881e2b71cd22902d942cc92",
      "text": "最近才想起来，\n所以打算来参加一下活动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eff0ad6543c33db419c9b8ba6a11c2f48fbc76acc11c0c97cce9693227a2fbe8",
      "text": "原来跟我们同一年级啊。\n怪不得总觉得好像在哪里见过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3005713ea69ec2c6c4a461ce60f21d74ce8fc759b21eb66acce7cd09bc84938",
      "text": "虽然是前辈……但同级……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1683759ab34b396821c53896cbd352228a6adcb0392bb103b533db2e19d52ed",
      "text": "嘛，反正我也是第一次来活动室，\n就把我当成新部员看就好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f9d8219a4bc7fb034e6f658e01e3703c6a84ba22bc9b0ca715ae3c75dadf685",
      "text": "我是若里春名。\n喜欢的东西是甜甜圈，讨厌的东西基本没有！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:044f7f545c9a39fcf2ebf8ea27bf21aa72c96410eac04765272637474730cd52",
      "text": "擅长的事情是做发型……\n乐器的话今后会好好练的，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfc6e2182765671c4ff1cf46ca129d1272582a1c50fce84a3b3169737976583",
      "text": "（擅、“擅长的事情是做发型”……！？\n好时髦，感觉会很受女生欢迎……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a25553c00ac2fb4b6f806d8fff54858256096d1e54dcd582a53dd3baef48559",
      "text": "那个，剩下没人的位置是鼓手，\n这样没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a5cb4515be2308aadaf8da5eceb1270600bc64da096a1a80d49fa59659863f",
      "text": "没问题。别看我这样，\n既然要做就会认真做好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d684969c03e3b10d76d9c0fbf81d8e41dd914baf6fc092e6ae1901a06afeca60",
      "text": "（也是为了避免留级……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bff4ba0b9f2be155572d6065dbb045cb0738091483dfebb1837ade3a2d85f616",
      "text": "对了。这是慰劳品甜甜圈。\n就当作是初次见面的心意，大家一起吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ca58793ff477cbdfe0205aa29be96384f48720e6c2c1972c055624391b27ce",
      "text": "哇——！太棒了！\n拍照吧拍照，拍照——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
